OL,3,GNEWSAPolish ambassador joins WW2 plaque
OL,4,Aunveiling
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at the unveiling on 2 October,
OL,7,FPolish Ambassador to the UK RafaEB
OL,8,FWiE[niewski said the "hospitality and
OL,9,Fsolidarity" shown here needed to be
OL,10,Fremembered today as "we are now again
OL,11,Fexposed to military conflict" in
OL,12,FEurope.
